{"parentUuid":"54d40260-0287-462b-bcef-5f8907d8c828","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"c0dcb81c-1a93-418b-82a5-bbfe558c5d2b","agentId":"a3a7c5b2195561b4b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014NLNZhpQ3UsuoNJwZSSgmW","type":"tool_result","content":"72:session (the fundamental unit), the training day, the microcycle, the mesocycle, the macrocycle, the Olympic (or \n579:obey common sense, which indicates that the fundamental unit of training should be the mesocycle and not the \n16:**What it is** — Periodisation is \"the overall long-term cyclic structuring of training and practice to maximise performance to coincide with important competitions\" (PDF p. 327 / printed p. 316, verified against the page image). Its structural units: training session (\"the fundamental unit\"), training day, microcycle, mesocycle, macrocycle, Olympic (quadrennial) cycle, multi-year cycle.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"56365c39-f2ed-48ad-8ce4-43f77fc861bc","timestamp":"2026-10-03T18:39:04.057Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"72:session (the fundamental unit), the training day, the microcycle, the mesocycle, the macrocycle, the Olympic (or \n579:obey common sense, which indicates that the fundamental unit of training should be the mesocycle and not the \n16:**What it is** — Periodisation is \"the overall long-term cyclic structuring of training and practice to maximise performance to coincide with important competitions\" (PDF p. 327 / printed p. 316, verified against the page image). Its structural units: training session (\"the fundamental unit\"), training day, microcycle, mesocycle, macrocycle, Olympic (quadrennial) cycle, multi-year cycle.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"54d40260-0287-462b-bcef-5f8907d8c828","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"s