es in `staging/_scope_supertraining_ch6b.txt`. I edited the 11 flagged entries plus two GO entries (`principle--load-must-sit-within-the-current-adaptation-reserve-window`, for the PDF 359 locator, the Bompa wording and a review-suggested reciprocal link; `heuristic--restorative-stage-length-scales-with-homeostatic-disturbance`, for a dangling \"entry above\" pointer). No new entries, so the scope file is unchanged (16 lines). No renames. I did not edit `_book.md`, any 6a, 6c or 6d file, or the vault."," "," ## Fig 6.22 reading (decided from the image)"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3c928f02-48ab-4574-86d5-6cc0d036be5d","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/kristinarash/DEV/Flint","sessionId":"9d08ef48-9f28-44dc-845b-1ca05ec6873c","version":"2.1.288","gitBranch":"supertraining-ch4-3-4"}
